#. All helps are here
#: src/include/iplb/helps.rb:35
msgid ""
"\n"
"<p><b><big>check interval</big> =</b> <i>n</i>\n"
"</p><p>Defines the number of second between server checks.\n"
"</p><p>Default: 10 seconds\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"<p><b><big>ໄລຍະຫ່າງການກວດສອບ</big> =</b> <i>n</i>\n"
"</p><p>ກຳນົດຈຳນວນວິນາທີລະຫວ່າງການກວດສອບເຊີເວີ.\n"
"</p><p>ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ: 10 ວິນາທີ\n"
"\n"

#: src/include/iplb/helps.rb:41 src/include/iplb/helps.rb:287
msgid ""
"</p><p><b><big>check timeout</big> =</b> <i>n</i>\n"
"</p><p>Timeout in seconds for connect, external and ping checks. If the "
"timeout is exceeded then the real server is declared dead.\n"
"</p><p>If defined in a virtual server section then the global value is "
"overridden.\n"
"</p><p>If undefined then the value of negotiatetimeout is used. "
"negotiatetimeout is also a global value that may be overriden by a per-"
"virtual setting.\n"
"</p><p>If both checktimeout and negotiatetimeout are unset, the default is "
"used.\n"
"</p><p>Default: 5 seconds\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"</p><p><b><big>ໝົດເວລາການກວດສອບ</big> =</b> <i>n</i>\n"
"</p><p>ກຳນົດເວລາໝົດອາຍຸເປັນວິນາທີສຳລັບການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່, ການກວດສອບຈາກພາຍນອກ ແລະ ການປິງ. ຖ້າເກີນກ"
"ຳນົດເວລາ, ເຊີເວີຈິງຈະຖືກລະບຸວ່າໃຊ້ງານບໍ່ໄດ້.\n"
"</p><p>ຖ້າກຳນົດໄວ້ໃນສ່ວນເຊີເວີສະເມືອນ, ຄ່າທົ່ວໄປຈະຖືກແທນທີ່.\n"
"</p><p>ຖ້າບໍ່ໄດ້ກຳນົດ, ຄ່າຂອງ negotiatetimeout ຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້. negotiatetimeout ເປັນຄ່າທົ່ວໄປ"
"ທີ່ອາດຖືກແທນທີ່ໂດຍການຕັ້ງຄ່າແຕ່ລະເຊີເວີສະເມືອນ.\n"
"</p><p>ຖ້າທັງ checktimeout ແລະ negotiatetimeout ບໍ່ໄດ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າໄວ້, ຈະໃຊ້ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ.\n"
"</p><p>ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ: 5 ວິນາທີ\n"
"\n"

#: src/include/iplb/helps.rb:48 src/include/iplb/helps.rb:301
msgid ""
"</p><p><b><big>failure count</big> =</b> <i>n</i>\n"
"</p><p>The number of consecutive times a failure will have to be reported by "
"a check before the realserver is considered to have failed.  A value of 1 "
"will have the realserver considered failed on the first failure.  A "
"successful check will reset the failure counter to 0.\n"
"</p><p>If defined in a virtual server section then the global value is "
"overridden.\n"
"</p><p>Default: 1\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"</p><p><b><big>ຈຳນວນຄັ້ງທີ່ຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ</big> =</b> <i>n</i>\n"
"</p><p>ຈຳນວນຄັ້ງທີ່ລາຍງານຄວາມຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວຕິດຕໍ່ກັນ ກ່ອນທີ່ເຊີເວີຈິງຈະຖືກພິຈາລະນາວ່າຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ. ຖ້າຕັ້ງເປັນ 1 ໝ"
"າຍຄວາມວ່າເຊີເວີຈະຖືກຖືວ່າຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວທັນທີໃນຄັ້ງທຳອິດທີ່ກວດສອບບໍ່ພົບ. ການກວດສອບທີ່ສຳເລັດຈະຕັ້ງຄ່າຕົວນັບຄວາມຫຼົ້"
"ມເຫຼວກັບເປັນ 0.\n"
"</p><p>ຖ້າກຳນົດໄວ້ໃນສ່ວນເຊີເວີສະເມືອນ, ຄ່າທົ່ວໄປຈະຖືກແທນທີ່.\n"
"</p><p>ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ: 1\n"
"\n"

#: src/include/iplb/helps.rb:53 src/include/iplb/helps.rb:294
msgid ""
"</p><p><b><big>negotiate timeout</big> =</b> <i>n</i>\n"
"</p><p>Timeout in seconds for negotiate checks.\n"
"</p><p>If defined in a virtual server section then the global value is "
"overridden.\n"
"</p><p>If undefined then the value of connecttimeout is used. connecttimeout "
"is also a global value that may be overriden by a per-virtual setting.\n"
"</p><p>If both negotiatetimeout and connecttimeout are unset, the default is "
"used.\n"
"</p><p>Default: 30 seconds\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"</p><p><b><big>ໝົດເວລາການເຈລະຈາ</big> =</b> <i>n</i>\n"
"</p><p>ກຳນົດເວລາໝົດອາຍຸເປັນວິນາທີສຳລັບການກວດສອບແບບເຈລະຈາ (negotiate).\n"
"</p><p>ຖ້າກຳນົດໄວ້ໃນສ່ວນເຊີເວີສະເມືອນ, ຄ່າທົ່ວໄປຈະຖືກແທນທີ່.\n"
"</p><p>ຖ້າບໍ່ໄດ້ກຳນົດ, ຄ່າຂອງ connecttimeout ຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້. connecttimeout ເປັນຄ່າທົ່ວໄປທີ່ອາດ"
"ຖືກແທນທີ່ໂດຍການຕັ້ງຄ່າແຕ່ລະເຊີເວີສະເມືອນ.\n"
"</p><p>ຖ້າທັງ negotiatetimeout ແລະ connecttimeout ບໍ່ໄດ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າໄວ້, ຈະໃຊ້ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ.\n"
"</p><p>ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ: 30 ວິນາທີ\n"
"\n"

#: src/include/iplb/helps.rb:60 src/include/iplb/helps.rb:325
msgid ""
"</p><p><b><big>fallback</big> =</b> <i>ip_address|hostname[:portnumber|"
"sercvicename]</i> [<b>gate</b>|<b>masq</b>|<b>ipip</b>]\n"
"</p><p>the server onto which a webservice is redirected if all real servers "
"are down. Typically this would be 127.0.0.1 with an emergency page.\n"
"</p><p>If defined in a virtual server section then the global value is "
"overridden.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"</p><p><b><big>ເຊີເວີສຳຮອງ</big> =</b> <i>"
"ip_address|hostname[:portnumber|sercvicename]</i> [<b>gate</b>|<b>masq</b>"
"|<b>ipip</b>]\n"
"</p><p>ເຊີເວີທີ່ຈະຖືກປ່ຽນເສັ້ນທາງໄປຫາ ຖ້າເຊີເວີຈິງທັງໝົດໃຊ້ງານບໍ່ໄດ້. ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປຈະເປັນ 127.0.0.1 ທີ່ມີ"
"ໜ້າເວັບແຈ້ງເຫດສຸກເສີນ.\n"
"</p><p>ຖ້າກຳນົດໄວ້ໃນສ່ວນເຊີເວີສະເມືອນ, ຄ່າທົ່ວໄປຈະຖືກແທນທີ່.\n"
"\n"

#: src/include/iplb/helps.rb:64
msgid ""
"</p><p><b><big>log file</big> = \"</b><i>/path/to/logfile</i><b>\"</b>|"
"syslog_facility\n"
"</p><p>An alternative logfile might be specified with this directive. If the "
"logfile does not have a leading '/', it is assumed to be a <b><a href=\"/"
"man/3/syslog\">syslog</a></b>(3) facility name.\n"
"</p><p>Default: log directly to the file <i>/var/log/ldirectord.log</i>.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"</p><p><b><big>ໄຟລ໌ບັນທຶກ</big> = \"</b><i>/path/to/logfile</i><b>\"</b>"
"|syslog_facility\n"
"</p><p>ສາມາດກຳນົດໄຟລ໌ບັນທຶກທາງເລືອກອື່ນໄດ້ດ້ວຍຄຳສັ່ງນີ້. ຖ້າໄຟລ໌ບັນທຶກບໍ່ໄດ້ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນດ້ວຍ '/', ມັນຈະຖືກຖື"
"ວ່າເປັນຊື່ <b><a href=\"/man/3/syslog\">syslog</a></b>(3) facility.\n"
"</p><p>ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ: ບັນທຶກລົງໃນໄຟລ໌ໂດຍກົງ <i>/var/log/ldirectord.log</i>.\n"
"\n"

#: src/include/iplb/helps.rb:68 src/include/iplb/helps.rb:306
msgid ""
"</p><p><b><big>email alert</big> = \"</b><i>emailaddress</i><b>\"</b>\n"
"</p><p>A valid email address for sending alerts about the changed connection "
"status to any real server defined in the virtual service. This option "
"requires perl\n"
"module MailTools to be installed. Automatically tries to send email using "
"any of the built-in methods. See perldoc Mail::Mailer for more info on "
"methods.\n"
"</p><p>If defined in a virtual server section then the global value is "
"overridden.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"</p><p><b><big>ແຈ້ງເຕືອນຜ່ານອີເມວ</big> = \"</b><i>emailaddress</i><b>\"</b>\n"
"</p><p>ທີ່ຢູ່ອີເມວທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງສຳລັບການສົ່ງຄຳແຈ້ງເຕືອນກ່ຽວກັບການປ່ຽນແປງສະຖານະການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໄປຫາເຊີເວີຈິງໃດ"
"ໜຶ່ງທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້. ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ຕ້ອງການຕິດຕັ້ງ\n"
"ໂມດູນ perl MailTools. ລະບົບຈະພະຍາຍາມສົ່ງອີເມວໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດໂດຍໃຊ້ວິທີທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນຕົວ. ເບິ່ງ "
"perldoc Mail::Mailer ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ.\n"
"</p><p>ຖ້າກຳນົດໄວ້ໃນສ່ວນເຊີເວີສະເມືອນ, ຄ່າທົ່ວໄປຈະຖືກແທນທີ່.\n"
"\n"

#: src/include/iplb/helps.rb:73 src/include/iplb/helps.rb:311
msgid ""
"</p><p><b><big>email alert freq</big> =</b> <i>n</i>\n"
"</p><p>Delay in seconds between repeating email alerts while any given real "
"server in the virtual service remains inaccessible. A setting of zero "
"seconds will\n"
"inhibit the repeating alerts. The email timing accuracy of this setting is "
"dependent on the number of seconds defined in the checkinterval "
"configuration\n"
"option.\n"
"</p><p>If defined in a virtual server section then the global value is "
"overridden.\n"
"</p><p>Default: 0\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"</p><p><b><big>ຄວາມຖີ່ການແຈ້ງເຕືອນອີເມວ</big> =</b> <i>n</i>\n"
"</p><p>ໄລຍະເວລາຊັກຊ້າເປັນວິນາທີລະຫວ່າງການສົ່ງອີເມວແຈ້ງເຕືອນຊ້ຳ ໃນຂະນະທີ່ເຊີເວີຈິງຍັງບໍ່ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິ"
"ງໄດ້. ການຕັ້ງເປັນ ສູນ \n"
"ຈະປິດການແຈ້ງເຕືອນຊ້ຳ. ຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງຂອງເວລາໃນການສົ່ງອີເມວແມ່ນຂຶ້ນກັບຈຳນວນວິນາທີທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ໃນຕົວເລືອກ "
"\n"
"checkinterval.\n"
"</p><p>ຖ້າກຳນົດໄວ້ໃນສ່ວນເຊີເວີສະເມືອນ, ຄ່າທົ່ວໄປຈະຖືກແທນທີ່.\n"
"</p><p>ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ: 0\n"
"\n"

#: src/include/iplb/helps.rb:80 src/include/iplb/helps.rb:318
msgid ""
"</p><p><b><big>email alert status</big> = all</b>|<b>none</b>|<b>starting</"
"b>|<b>running</b>|<b>stopping</b>|<b>reloading</b>,...\n"
"</p><p>Comma delimited list of server states in which email alerts should be "
"sent. <b>all</b> is a short-hand for\n"
"\"<b>starting</b>,<b>running</b>,<b>stopping</b>,<b>reloading</b>\". If "
"<b>none</b> is specified, no other option may be specified, otherwise "
"options are ORed\n"
"with each other.\n"
"</p><p>If defined in a virtual server section then the global value is "
"overridden.\n"
"</p><p>Default: all\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"</p><p><b><big>ສະຖານະການແຈ້ງເຕືອນຜ່ານອີເມລ</big> = all</b>|<b>none</b>|<b>"
"starting</b>|<b>running</b>|<b>stopping</b>|<b>reloading</b>,...\n"
"</p><p>ລາຍການທີ່ຂັ້ນດ້ວຍຈຸດ (comma) ຂອງສະຖານະເຊີເວີທີ່ຄວນສົ່ງການແຈ້ງເຕືອນຜ່ານອີເມລ. <b>all</"
"b> ແມ່ນຕົວຫຍໍ້ສຳລັບ\n"
"\"<b>starting</b>,<b>running</b>,<b>stopping</b>,<b>reloading</b>\". ຖ້າ <b>"
"none</b> ຖືກລະບຸ, ຈະບໍ່ສາມາດລະບຸຕົວເລືອກອື່ນໄດ້, ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ ຕົວເລືອກຕ່າງໆຈະຖືກລວມເຂົ້າກັນ\n"
"ດ້ວຍເງື່ອນໄຂ \"ຫຼື\" (ORed).\n"
"</p><p>ຖ້າຖືກກຳນົດຢູ່ໃນສ່ວນຂອງເວີຊົວເຊີເວີ, ຄ່າທົ່ວໄປຈະຖືກຂຽນທັບ.\n"
"</p><p>ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ: all\n"
"\n"

#: src/include/iplb/helps.rb:87
msgid ""
"</p><p><b><big>callback</big> = \"</b><i>/path/to/callback</i><b>\"</b>\n"
"</p><p>If this directive is defined, <b>ldirectord</b> automatically calls "
"the executable <i>/path/to/callback</i> after the configuration file has "
"changed on\n"
"disk. This is useful to update the configuration file through <b>scp</b> on "
"the other heartbeated host. The first argument to the callback is the name "
"of the\n"
"configuration.\n"
"</p><p>This directive might also be used to restart <b>ldirectord</b> "
"automatically after the configuration file changed on disk. However, if "
"<b>autoreload</b> is\n"
"set to yes, the configuration is reloaded anyway.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"</p><p><b><big>callback</big> = \"</b><i>/path/to/callback</i><b>\"</b>\n"
"</p><p>ຖ້າຄຳສັ່ງນີ້ຖືກກຳນົດ, <b>ldirectord</b> ຈະເອີ້ນໃຊ້ໄຟລ໌ທີ່ສາມາດເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ <i>/path/to/"
"callback</i> ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ ຫຼັງຈາກໄຟລ໌ກຳນົດຄ່າຖືກປ່ຽນແປງໃນ\n"
"ດິສກ໌. ນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດໃນການອັບເດດໄຟລ໌ກຳນົດຄ່າຜ່ານ <b>scp</b> ໃນໂຮສ heartbeated ອື່ນ. ອາກິວເມນທ"
"ຳອິດຂອງ callback ແມ່ນຊື່ຂອງ\n"
"ການກຳນົດຄ່າ.\n"
"</p><p>ຄຳສັ່ງນີ້ອາດຈະຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອເລີ່ມ <b>ldirectord</b> ໃໝ່ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ ຫຼັງຈາກໄຟລ໌ກຳນົດຄ່າໃນດິ"
"ສກ໌ຖືກປ່ຽນແປງ. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ຖ້າ <b>autoreload</b> ຖືກ\n"
"ຕັ້ງເປັນ yes, ການກຳນົດຄ່າຈະຖືກໂຫຼດຄືນໃໝ່ຢູ່ແລ້ວ.\n"
"\n"

#: src/include/iplb/helps.rb:94
msgid ""
"</p><p><b><big>execute</big> = \"</b><i>configuration</i><b>\"</b>\n"
"</p><p>Use this directive to start an instance of ldirectord for the named "
"<i>configuration</i>.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"</p><p><b><big>ປະຕິບັດການ (execute)</big> = \"</b><i>configuration</i><b>\"</b>"
"\n"
"</p><p>ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງນີ້ເພື່ອເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ instance ຂອງ ldirectord ສຳລັບ <i>ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ</i> ທີ່ລະບຸຊື່ໄວ້.\n"
"\n"

#: src/include/iplb/helps.rb:97
msgid ""
"</p><p><b><big>auto reload</big> = yes</b>|<b>no</b>\n"
"</p><p>Defines if &lt;ldirectord&gt; should continuously check the "
"configuration file for modification. If this is set to 'yes' and the "
"configuration file changed\n"
"on disk and its modification time (mtime) is newer than the previous "
"version, the configuration is automatically reloaded.\n"
"</p><p>Default: no\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"</p><p><b><big>ໂຫຼດຄືນອັດຕະໂນມັດ</big> = yes</b>|<b>no</b>\n"
"</p><p>ກຳນົດວ່າ &lt;ldirectord&gt; ຄວນກວດສອບການປ່ຽນແປງຂອງໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຢ່າງຕໍ່ເນື່ອງຫຼືບໍ່. ຖ້"
"າຕັ້ງເປັນ 'yes' ແລະ ໄຟລ໌ມີການປ່ຽນແປງ\n"
"ໃນດິດ ເຊິ່ງມີເວລາແກ້ໄຂ (mtime) ໃໝ່ກວ່າເວີຊັນກ່ອນໜ້າ, ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຈະຖືກໂຫຼດຄືນໃໝ່ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ.\n"
"</p><p>ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ: no\n"
"\n"

#: src/include/iplb/helps.rb:102
msgid ""
"</p><p><b><big>quiescent</big> = yes</b>|<b>no</b>\n"
"</p><p>If <i>yes</i>, then when real or failback servers are determined to "
"be down, they are not actually removed from the kernel's <small>LVS</small> "
"table.\n"
"Rather, their weight is set to zero which means that no new connections will "
"be accepted.\n"
"</p><p>This has the side effect, that if the real server has persistent "
"connections, new connections from any existing clients will continue to be "
"routed to the\n"
"real server, until the persistant timeout can expire. See ipvsadm for more "
"information on persistant connections.\n"
"</p><p>This side-effect can be avoided by running the following:\n"
"</p><p>echo 1 &gt; /proc/sys/net/ipv4/vs/expire_quiescent_template\n"
"</p><p>If the proc file isn't present this probably means that the kernel "
"doesn't have lvs support, <small>LVS</small> support isn't loaded, or the "
"kernel is too\n"
"old to have the proc file. Running ipvsadm as root should load <small>LVS</"
"small> into the kernel if it is possible.\n"
"</p><p>If <i>no</i>, then the real or failback servers will be removed from "
"the kernel's <small>LVS</small> table. The default is <i>yes</i>.\n"
"</p><p>If defined in a virtual server section then the global value is "
"overridden.\n"
"</p><p>Default: <i>yes</i>\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"</p><p><b><big>quiescent</big> = yes</b>|<b>no</b>\n"
"</p><p>ຖ້າແມ່ນ <i>yes</i>, ເມື່ອເຊີເວີຈິງ ຫຼື ເຊີເວີສຳຮອງ (failback) ຖືກກວດພົບວ່າຢຸດເຮັດວຽກ, "
"ພວກມັນຈະບໍ່ຖືກລຶບອອກຈາກຕາຕະລາງ <small>LVS</small> ຂອງເຄີເນີນແທ້ໆ.\n"
"ແຕ່ຄ່ານ້ຳໜັກຂອງພວກມັນຈະຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນສູນ ເຊິ່ງໝາຍຄວາມວ່າຈະບໍ່ມີການຮັບການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໃໝ່.\n"
"</p><p>ອັນນີ້ມີຜົນຂ້າງຄຽງຄື, ຖ້າເຊີເວີຈິງມີການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ແບບຄົງຄ້າງ (persistent connections), ການ"
"ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໃໝ່ຈາກໄຄເອັນທີ່ມີຢູ່ຈະຍັງຄົງຖືກສົ່ງໄປຫາ\n"
"ເຊີເວີຈິງ, ຈົນກວ່າເວລາໝົດອາຍຸຂອງການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ແບບຄົງຄ້າງຈະສິ້ນສຸດລົງ. ເບິ່ງ ipvsadm ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່"
"ຽວກັບການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ແບບຄົງຄ້າງ.\n"
"</p><p>ຜົນຂ້າງຄຽງນີ້ສາມາດຫຼີກເວັ້ນໄດ້ໂດຍການລັນຄຳສັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:\n"
"</p><p>echo 1 &gt; /proc/sys/net/ipv4/vs/expire_quiescent_template\n"
"</p><p>ຖ້າບໍ່ມີໄຟລ໌ proc ນີ້ ມັນອາດຈະໝາຍຄວາມວ່າເຄີເນີນບໍ່ຮອງຮັບ lvs, ການຮອງຮັບ <small>LVS</"
"small> ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກໂຫຼດ, ຫຼື ເຄີເນີນເກົ່າເກີນໄປ\n"
"ທີ່ຈະມີໄຟລ໌ proc. ການລັນ ipvsadm ໃນຖານະ root ຄວນຈະໂຫຼດ <small>LVS</small> ເຂົ້າໄປໃນເຄີ"
"ເນີນຖ້າເປັນໄປໄດ້.\n"
"</p><p>ຖ້າແມ່ນ <i>no</i>, ເຊີເວີຈິງ ຫຼື ເຊີເວີສຳຮອງຈະຖືກລຶບອອກຈາກຕາຕະລາງ <small>LVS</"
"small> ຂອງເຄີເນີນ. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ <i>yes</i>.\n"
"</p><p>ຖ້າຖືກກຳນົດໃນພາກສ່ວນເວີຊົວເຊີເວີ ຄ່າສ່ວນກາງຈະຖືກຂຽນທັບ.\n"
"</p><p>ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ: <i>yes</i>\n"
"\n"

#: src/include/iplb/helps.rb:115
msgid ""
"</p><p><b><big>fork</big> = yes</b>|<b>no</b>\n"
"</p><p>If <i>yes</i>, then ldirectord will spawn a child proccess for every "
"virtual server, and run checks against the real servers from them. This will "
"increase\n"
"response times to changes in real server status in configurations with many "
"virtual servers. This may also use less memory then running many seperate "
"instances\n"
"of ldirectord. Child processes will be automaticly restarted if they die.\n"
"</p><p>Default: <i>no</i>\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"</p><p><b><big>ແຍກໂປຣເຊສ (fork)</big> = yes</b>|<b>no</b>\n"
"</p><p>ຖ້າເປັນ <i>yes</i>, ldirectord ຈະສ້າງໂປຣເຊສລູກ (child process) ສຳລັບທຸກໆເຊີເວີ"
"ສະເມືອນ ແລະ ກວດສອບເຊີເວີຈິງຈາກໂປຣເຊສເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"
"ນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍເພີ່ມຄວາມໄວໃນການຕອບສະໜອງຕໍ່ການປ່ຽນແປງສະຖານະເຊີເວີ ໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ມີເຊີເວີສະເມືອນຈຳນວນຫຼາ"
"ຍ.\n"
"ນອກຈາກນີ້ຍັງອາດໃຊ້ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳໜ້ອຍກວ່າການເປີດ ldirectord ຫຼາຍໆ instance ແຍກກັນ. ໂປຣເຊສລູກຈ"
"ະຖືກເລີ່ມໃໝ່ອັດຕະໂນມັດຖ້າຫາກມັນຢຸດເຮັດວຽກ.\n"
"</p><p>ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ: <i>no</i>\n"
"\n"

#: src/include/iplb/helps.rb:121
msgid ""
"</p><p><b><big>supervised</big> = yes</b>|<b>no</b>\n"
"</p><p>If <i>yes</i>, then ldirectord does not go into background mode. All "
"log-messages are redirected to stdout instead of a logfile. This is useful "
"to run\n"
"<b>ldirectord</b> supervised from daemontools. See <a href=\"http://"
"untroubled.org/rpms/daemontools/\">http://untroubled.org/rpms/daemontools/</"
"a> or <a href=\"http://cr.yp.to/daemontools.html\">http://cr.yp.to/"
"daemontools.html</a> for details.\n"
"</p><p>Default: <i>no</i>\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"</p><p><b><big>ຖືກກຳກັບດູແລ (supervised)</big> = yes</b>|<b>no</b>\n"
"</p><p>ຖ້າເປັນ <i>yes</i>, ldirectord ຈະບໍ່ເຮັດວຽກໃນໂໝດເບື້ອງຫຼັງ (background). ຂໍ້ຄວາມບັ"
"ນທຶກທັງໝົດຈະຖືກສົ່ງໄປຫາ stdout ແທນທີ່ຈະເປັນໄຟລ໌ບັນທຶກ.\n"
"ນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດສຳລັບການໃຊ້ງານ <b>ldirectord</b> ພາຍໃຕ້ການກຳກັບດູແລຂອງ daemontools. ເບິ່ງລາຍ"
"ລະອຽດທີ່ <a href=\"http://untroubled.org/rpms/daemontools/\">http://"
"untroubled.org/rpms/daemontools/</a> ຫຼື <a href=\"http://cr.yp.to/"
"daemontools.html\">http://cr.yp.to/daemontools.html</a>.\n"
"</p><p>ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ: <i>no</i>\n"
"</p>\n"

#: src/include/iplb/helps.rb:127
msgid ""
"\n"
"<p><b><big>virtual server</big> =</b> <i>(ip_address|hostname:portnumber|"
"servicename)|firewall-mark</i>\n"
"</p><p>Defines a virtual service by IP-address (or hostname) and port (or "
"servicename) or firewall-mark. A firewall-mark is an integer greater than "
"zero. The\n"
"configuration of marking packets is controled using the <tt>\"-m\"</tt> "
"option to <b>ipchains</b>(8). All real services and flags for a virtual "
"service\n"
"must follow this line immediately and be indented.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"<p><b><big>ເຊີເວີສະເມືອນ</big> =</b> <i>"
"(ip_address|hostname:portnumber|servicename)|firewall-mark</i>\n"
"</p><p>ກຳນົດການບໍລິການສະເມືອນດ້ວຍທີ່ຢູ່ IP (ຫຼື ຊື່ໂຮສ) ແລະ ພອດ (ຫຼື ຊື່ບໍລິການ) ຫຼື firewall-"
"mark.\n"
"firewall-mark ແມ່ນຕົວເລກຖ້ວນທີ່ຫຼາຍກວ່າສູນ. ການຕັ້ງຄ່າການໝາຍແພັກເກັດແມ່ນຄວບຄຸມໂດຍໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກ "
"<tt>\"-m\"</tt> \n"
"ໃນ <b>ipchains</b>(8). ການບໍລິການຈິງ ແລະ ແຟລັກ (flags) ທັງໝົດສຳລັບການບໍລິການສະເມືອນ ຈະຕ້"
"ອງຢູ່ຖັດຈາກແຖວນີ້ ແລະ ຫຍໍ້ໜ້າເຂົ້າ.\n"
"\n"
"\n"

#: src/include/iplb/helps.rb:135
msgid ""
"</p><p><b><big>real servers</big> =</b> <i>ip_address|hostname[-&gt;"
"ip_address|hostname][:portnumber|servicename</i>]\n"
"<b>gate</b>|<b>masq</b>|<b>ipip</b> [<i>weight</i>] [<b>\"</b><i>request</"
"i><b>\", \"</b><i>receive</i><b>\"</b>]\n"
"</p><p>Defines a real service by IP-address (or hostname) and port (or "
"servicename). If the port is omitted then a 0 will be used, this is intended "
"primarily for\n"
"fwmark services where the port for real servers is ignored. Optionally a "
"range of <small>IP</small> addresses (or two hostnames) may be given, in "
"which case\n"
"each <small>IP</small> address in the range will be treated as a real server "
"using the given port. The second argument defines the forwarding method, "
"must be\n"
"<b>gate</b>, <b>ipip</b> or <b>masq</b>. The thrid argument is optional and "
"defines the weight for that real server. If omitted then a weight of 1 will "
"be\n"
"used. The last two arguments are also optional. They define a request-"
"receive pair to be used to check if a server is alive. They override the "
"request-receive\n"
"pair in the virtual server section. These two strings must be quoted. If the "
"request string starts with http://... the IP-address and port of the real\n"
"server is overridden, otherwise the IP-address and port of the real server "
"is used.\n"
msgstr ""
"</p><p><b><big>real servers</big> =</b> <i>ip_address|hostname[-"
"&gt;ip_address|hostname][:portnumber|servicename</i>]\n"
"<b>gate</b>|<b>masq</b>|<b>ipip</b> [<i>weight</i>] [<b>\"</b><i>request</i>"
"<b>\", \"</b><i>receive</i><b>\"</b>]\n"
"</p><p>ນິຍາມບໍລິການຈິງໂດຍທີ່ຢູ່ IP (ຫຼື ຊື່ໂຮສ) ແລະ ພອດ (ຫຼື ຊື່ບໍລິການ). ຖ້າລະເວັ້ນພອດ ຈະມີການໃຊ້ຄ່"
"າ 0 ແທນ, ນີ້ແມ່ນມີຈຸດປະສົງຫຼັກສຳລັບ\n"
"ບໍລິການ fwmark ເຊິ່ງພອດສຳລັບເຊີເວີຈິງຈະຖືກລະເລີຍ. ອາດຈະມີການລະບຸຊ່ວງຂອງທີ່ຢູ່ <small>IP</"
"small> (ຫຼື ສອງຊື່ໂຮສ) ໄດ້ຕາມຄວາມສະໝັກໃຈ, ໃນກໍລະນີນີ້\n"
"ແຕ່ລະທີ່ຢູ່ <small>IP</small> ໃນຊ່ວງນັ້ນຈະຖືກປະຕິບັດຄືກັບເປັນເຊີເວີຈິງໂດຍໃຊ້ພອດທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້. ອາກິວເມນທີ"
"ສອງແມ່ນນິຍາມວິທີການສົ່ງຕໍ່, ເຊິ່ງຕ້ອງແມ່ນ\n"
"<b>gate</b>, <b>ipip</b> ຫຼື <b>masq</b>. ອາກິວເມນທີສາມແມ່ນທາງເລືອກ ແລະ ນິຍາມຄ່ານ້ຳໜັກສ"
"ຳລັບເຊີເວີຈິງນັ້ນ. ຖ້າລະເວັ້ນ ຄ່ານ້ຳໜັກ 1 ຈະຖືກ\n"
"ນຳໃຊ້. ສອງອາກິວເມນສຸດທ້າຍແມ່ນທາງເລືອກເຊັ່ນກັນ. ພວກມັນນິຍາມຄູ່ຂອງການຮ້ອງຂໍ-ການຮັບ ເພື່ອໃຊ້ກວດສອບວ່"
"າເຊີເວີຍັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ຫຼືບໍ່. ພວກມັນຈະຂຽນທັບຄູ່ຂອງການຮ້ອງຂໍ-ການຮັບ\n"
"ໃນພາກສ່ວນຂອງເວີຊົວເຊີເວີ. ສອງຂໍ້ຄວາມນີ້ຕ້ອງຢູ່ໃນເຄື່ອງໝາຍຄຳເວົ້າ. ຖ້າຂໍ້ຄວາມການຮ້ອງຂໍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນດ້ວຍ "
"http://... ທີ່ຢູ່ IP ແລະ ພອດຂອງເຊີເວີຈິງ\n"
"ຈະຖືກຂຽນທັບ, ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ ຈະໃຊ້ທີ່ຢູ່ IP ແລະ ພອດຂອງເຊີເວີຈິງ.\n"

#: src/include/iplb/helps.rb:144
msgid ""
"</p><p>For <small>TCP</small> and <small>UDP</small> (non fwmark) virtual "
"services, unless the forwarding method is masq and the <small>IP</small> "
"address of a\n"
"real server is non-local (not present on a interface on the host running "
"ldirectord) then the port of the real server will be set to that of its "
"virtual\n"
"service. That is, port-mapping is only available to if the real server is "
"another machine and the forwarding method is masq. This is due to the way "
"that the\n"
"underlying <small>LVS</small> code in the kernel functions.\n"
"</p><p>More than one of these entries may be inside a virtual section. The "
"checktimeout, negotiatetimeout, failurecount, fallback, emailalert, "
"emailalertfreq and\n"
"quiescent options listed above may also appear inside a virtual section, in "
"which case the global setting is overridden.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"</p><p>ສຳລັບການບໍລິການສະເໝືອນ <small>TCP</small> ແລະ <small>UDP</small> (ທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນ "
"fwmark), ນອກຈາກວ່າວິທີການສົ່ງຕໍ່ແມ່ນ masq ແລະ ທີ່ຢູ່ <small>IP</small> ຂອງ\n"
"ເຊີເວີຈິງແມ່ນບໍ່ແມ່ນພາຍໃນ (ບໍ່ມີຢູ່ໃນອິນເຕີເຟດເທິງໂຮສທີ່ກຳລັງແລ່ນ ldirectord) ແລ້ວພອດຂອງເຊີເວີຈິງຈະຖື"
"ກຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ເປັນຄືກັນກັບການບໍລິການສະເໝືອນ\n"
"ຂອງມັນ. ນັ້ນແມ່ນ, ການຈັບຄູ່ພອດແມ່ນສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ພຽງແຕ່ຖ້າເຊີເວີຈິງແມ່ນເຄື່ອງອື່ນ ແລະ ວິທີການສົ່ງຕໍ່ແມ່ນ "
"masq. ນີ້ແມ່ນເນື່ອງມາຈາກວິທີທີ່\n"
"ລະຫັດ <small>LVS</small> ພື້ນຖານໃນເຄີເນີນເຮັດວຽກ.\n"
"</p><p>ສາມາດມີຫຼາຍກວ່າໜຶ່ງລາຍການເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຢູ່ພາຍໃນສ່ວນສະເໝືອນ. ຕົວເລືອກ checktimeout, "
"negotiatetimeout, failurecount, fallback, emailalert, emailalertfreq ແລະ\n"
"quiescent ທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ຂ້າງເທິງນັ້ນ ອາດຈະປາກົດຢູ່ໃນສ່ວນສະເໝືອນເຊັ່ນກັນ, ເຊິ່ງໃນກໍລະນີດັ່ງກ່າວ ການຕັ້ງຄ່າລວ"
"ມຈະຖືກຂຽນທັບ.\n"
"\n"
"\n"

#: src/include/iplb/helps.rb:152
msgid ""
"</p><p><b><big>check type</big> = connect</b>|<b>external</b>|<b>negotiate</"
"b>|<b>off</b>|<b>on</b>|<b>ping</b>|<b>checktimeout</b><i>N</i>\n"
"</p><p>Type of check to perform. Negotiate sends a request and matches a "
"receive string. Connect only attemts to make a <small>TCP/IP</small> "
"connection, thus the\n"
"request and receive strings may be omitted. If checktype is a number then "
"negotiate and connect is combined so that after each N connect attempts one "
"negotiate\n"
"attempt is performed. This is useful to check often if a service answers and "
"in much longer intervalls a negotiating check is done. Ping means that\n"
"<small>ICMP</small> ping will be used to test the availability of real "
"servers. Ping is also used as the connect check for <small>UDP</small> "
"services. Off\n"
"means no checking will take place and no real or fallback servers will be "
"activated. On means no checking will take place and real servers will always "
"be\n"
"activated. Default is <i>negotiate</i>.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"</p><p><b><big>ປະເພດການກວດສອບ</big> = connect</b>|<b>external</b>|<b>"
"negotiate</b>|<b>off</b>|<b>on</b>|<b>ping</b>|<b>checktimeout</b><i>N</i>\n"
"</p><p>ປະເພດຂອງການກວດສອບທີ່ຈະດຳເນີນການ. Negotiate ຈະສົ່ງການຮ້ອງຂໍ ແລະ ກວດສອບໃຫ້ກົງກັບຂໍ້ຄ"
"ວາມທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບ. Connect ພະຍາຍາມສ້າງການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ <small>TCP/IP</small> ເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນ\n"
"ຂໍ້ຄວາມການຮ້ອງຂໍ ແລະ ຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບອາດຈະຖືກຂ້າມໄປ. ຖ້າ checktype ເປັນຕົວເລກ ແລ້ວ negotiate "
"ແລະ connect ຈະຖືກລວມເຂົ້າກັນ ເພື່ອວ່າຫຼັງຈາກການພະຍາຍາມ connect ທຸກໆ N ຄັ້ງ ຈະມີການພະຍາຍາມ "
"negotiate\n"
"ໜຶ່ງຄັ້ງ. ນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດໃນການກວດສອບເລື້ອຍໆວ່າການບໍລິການມີການຕອບສະໜອງຫຼືບໍ່ ແລະ ຈະມີການກວດສອບແບບ "
"negotiate ໃນຊ່ວງເວລາທີ່ຫ່າງກັນຫຼາຍກວ່າ. Ping ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າ\n"
"<small>ICMP</small> ping ຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ເພື່ອທົດສອບຄວາມພ້ອມໃຊ້ງານຂອງເຊີເວີຕົວຈິງ. Ping ຍັງຖືກໃຊ້"
"ເປັນການກວດສອບການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ສຳລັບການບໍລິການ <small>UDP</small>. Off\n"
"ໝາຍເຖິງຈະບໍ່ມີການກວດສອບເກີດຂຶ້ນ ແລະ ຈະບໍ່ມີເຊີເວີຕົວຈິງ ຫຼື ເຊີເວີສຳຮອງຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ງານ. On ໝາຍເຖິງຈະບໍ່"
"ມີການກວດສອບເກີດຂຶ້ນ ແລະ ເຊີເວີຕົວຈິງຈະຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ງານ\n"
"ຕະຫຼອດເວລາ. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ <i>negotiate</i>.\n"
"\n"
"\n"

#: src/include/iplb/helps.rb:161
msgid ""
"</p><p><b><big>service</big> = dns</b>|<b>ftp</b>|<b>http</b>|<b>https</b>|"
"<b>imap</b>|<b>imaps</b>|<b>ldap</b>|<b>mysql</b>|<b>nntp</b>|<b>none</b>|"
"<b>oracle</b>|<b>pgsql</b>|<b>pop</b>|<b>pops</b>|<b>radius</b>|"
"<b>simpletcp</b>|<b>sip</b>|<b>smtp</b>\n"
"</p><p>The type of service to monitor when using checktype=negotiate. None "
"denotes a service that will not be monitored.\n"
"</p><p>simpletcp sends the <b>request</b> string to the server and tests it "
"against the <b>receive</b> regexp. The other types of checks connect to the "
"server\n"
"using the specified protocol. Please see the <b>request</b> and <b>receive</"
"b> sections for protocol specific information.\n"
"</p><p>Default:\n"
msgstr ""
"</p><p><b><big>ບໍລິການ</big> = dns</b>|<b>ftp</b>|<b>http</b>|<b>https</b>|<b>"
"imap</b>|<b>imaps</b>|<b>ldap</b>|<b>mysql</b>|<b>nntp</b>|<b>none</b>|<b>"
"oracle</b>|<b>pgsql</b>|<b>pop</b>|<b>pops</b>|<b>radius</b>|<b>simpletcp</b>"
"|<b>sip</b>|<b>smtp</b>\n"
"</p><p>ປະເພດຂອງບໍລິການທີ່ຈະກວດສອບເມື່ອໃຊ້ checktype=negotiate. None ໝາຍເຖິງບໍລິການທີ່ຈະບໍ່ຖື"
"ກກວດສອບ.\n"
"</p><p>simpletcp ສົ່ງສະຕຣິງ <b>ຄຳຮ້ອງຂໍ</b> (request) ຫາເຊີເວີ ແລະ ທົດສອບມັນກັບ regexp "
"<b>ການຮັບ</b> (receive). ການກວດສອບປະເພດອື່ນໆແມ່ນເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຫາເຊີເວີ\n"
"ໂດຍໃຊ້ໂປຣໂຕຄໍທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້. ກະລຸນາເບິ່ງພາກສ່ວນ <b>ຄຳຮ້ອງຂໍ</b> (request) ແລະ <b>ການຮັບ</b> "
"(receive) ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນສະເພາະຂອງໂປຣໂຕຄໍ.\n"
"</p><p>ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ:\n"

#: src/include/iplb/helps.rb:166
msgid ""
"</p><dl compact=\"compact\">\n"
"<dt>* Virtual server port is 21: ftp\n"
"</dt><dt>* Virtual server port is 25: smtp\n"
"</dt><dt>* Virtual server port is 53: dns\n"
"</dt><dt>* Virtual server port is 80: http\n"
"</dt><dt>* Virtual server port is 110: pop\n"
"</dt><dt>* Virtual server port is 119: nntp\n"
"</dt><dt>* Virtual server port is 143: imap\n"
"</dt><dt>* Virtual server port is 389: ldap\n"
"</dt><dt>* Virtual server port is 443: https\n"
"</dt><dt>* Virtual server port is 993: imaps\n"
"</dt><dt>* Virtual server port is 995: pops\n"
"</dt><dt>* Virtual server port is 1521: oracle\n"
"</dt><dt>* Virtual server port is 1812: radius\n"
"</dt><dt>* Virtual server port is 3306: mysql\n"
"</dt><dt>* Virtual server port is 5432: pgsql\n"
"</dt><dt>* Virtual server port is 5060: sip\n"
"</dt><dt>* Otherwise: none\n"
"\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"</p><dl compact=\"compact\">\n"
"<dt>* ພອດເຊີເວີສະເມືອນແມ່ນ 21: ftp\n"
"</dt><dt>* ພອດເຊີເວີສະເມືອນແມ່ນ 25: smtp\n"
"</dt><dt>* ພອດເຊີເວີສະເມືອນແມ່ນ 53: dns\n"
"</dt><dt>* ພອດເຊີເວີສະເມືອນແມ່ນ 80: http\n"
"</dt><dt>* ພອດເຊີເວີສະເມືອນແມ່ນ 110: pop\n"
"</dt><dt>* ພອດເຊີເວີສະເມືອນແມ່ນ 119: nntp\n"
"</dt><dt>* ພອດເຊີເວີສະເມືອນແມ່ນ 143: imap\n"
"</dt><dt>* ພອດເຊີເວີສະເມືອນແມ່ນ 389: ldap\n"
"</dt><dt>* ພອດເຊີເວີສະເມືອນແມ່ນ 443: https\n"
"</dt><dt>* ພອດເຊີເວີສະເມືອນແມ່ນ 993: imaps\n"
"</dt><dt>* ພອດເຊີເວີສະເມືອນແມ່ນ 995: pops\n"
"</dt><dt>* ພອດເຊີເວີສະເມືອນແມ່ນ 1521: oracle\n"
"</dt><dt>* ພອດເຊີເວີສະເມືອນແມ່ນ 1812: radius\n"
"</dt><dt>* ພອດເຊີເວີສະເມືອນແມ່ນ 3306: mysql\n"
"</dt><dt>* ພອດເຊີເວີສະເມືອນແມ່ນ 5432: pgsql\n"
"</dt><dt>* ພອດເຊີເວີສະເມືອນແມ່ນ 5060: sip\n"
"</dt><dt>* ກໍລະນີອື່ນໆ: none\n"
"\n"
"\n"

#: src/include/iplb/helps.rb:186
msgid ""
"</dt><dt><b><big>check command</big> = \"</b><i>path to script</i><b>\"</b>\n"
"<p>This setting is used if checktype is external and is the command to be "
"run to check the status of a real server. It should exit with status 0 if "
"everything\n"
"is ok, or non-zero otherwise.\n"
"</p><p>Four parameters are passed to the script:\n"
"</p></dt><dt>* virtual server ip/firewall mark\n"
"</dt><dt>* virtual server port\n"
"</dt><dt>* real server ip\n"
"</dt><dt>* real server port\n"
"</dt><dt>Default: /bin/true\n"
"\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"</dt><dt><b><big>ຄຳສັ່ງກວດສອບ</big> = \"</b><i>path to script</i><b>\"</b>\n"
"<p>ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ໃຊ້ເມື່ອ checktype ເປັນ external. ມັນແມ່ນຄຳສັ່ງທີ່ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ກວດສອບສະຖານະເຊີເວີຈິງ. "
"\n"
"ມັນຄວນຈະຈົບການເຮັດວຽກດ້ວຍສະຖານະ 0 ຖ້າທຸກຢ່າງປົກກະຕິ.\n"
"</p><p>ມີສີ່ພາຣາມິເຕີທີ່ຈະຖືກສົ່ງໄປຫາສະຄຣິບ:\n"
"</p></dt><dt>* virtual server ip/firewall mark\n"
"</dt><dt>* virtual server port\n"
"</dt><dt>* real server ip\n"
"</dt><dt>* real server port\n"
"</dt><dt>ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ: /bin/true\n"
"\n"
"\n"

#: src/include/iplb/helps.rb:197
msgid ""
"<p><b><big>check port</big> =</b> <i>n</i>\n"
"</p><p>Number of port to monitor. Sometimes check port differs from service "
"port.\n"
"</p><p>Default: port specified for each real server\n"
"\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><b><big>ພອດກວດສອບ</big> =</b> <i>n</i>\n"
"</p><p>ໝາຍເລກພອດທີ່ຈະຕິດຕາມ. ບາງຄັ້ງພອດກວດສອບອາດຈະຕ່າງຈາກພອດບໍລິການ.\n"
"</p><p>ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ: ພອດທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ໃນແຕ່ລະເຊີເວີຈິງ\n"
"\n"
"\n"

#: src/include/iplb/helps.rb:202
msgid ""
"</p><p><b><big>request</big> = \"</b><i>uri to requested object</i><b>\"</"
"b>\n"
"</p><p>This object will be requested each checkinterval seconds on each real "
"server. The string must be inside quotes. Note that this string may be "
"overridden by\n"
"an optional per real-server based request-string.\n"
"</p><p>For a <small>DNS</small> check this should the name of an A record, "
"or the address of a <small>PTR</small> record to look up.\n"
"</p><p>For a MySQL, Oracle or PostgeSQL check, this should be an <small>SQL</"
"small> query. The data returned is not checked, only that the answer is one "
"or more\n"
"rows. This is a required setting.\n"
"</p><p>For a simpletcp check, this string is sent verbatim except any "
"occurances of \n"
" are replaced with a new line character.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"</p><p><b><big>request</big> = \"</b><i>ຢູອາໄອ (URI) ໄປຫາວັດຖຸທີ່ຖືກຮ້ອງຂໍ</i><b>\"</"
"b>\n"
"</p><p>ວັດຖຸນີ້ຈະຖືກຮ້ອງຂໍໃນທຸກໆ checkinterval ວິນາທີ ໃນແຕ່ລະລຽວເຊີເວີ (real server). ຂໍ້ຄວາ"
"ມຕ້ອງຢູ່ພາຍໃນເຄື່ອງໝາຍຄຳເວົ້າ. ໝາຍເຫດວ່າຂໍ້ຄວາມນີ້ອາດຈະຖືກແທນທີ່ໂດຍ\n"
"ຂໍ້ຄວາມການຮ້ອງຂໍ (request-string) ທາງເລືອກໂດຍອີງຕາມແຕ່ລະລຽວເຊີເວີ.\n"
"</p><p>ສຳລັບການກວດສອບ <small>DNS</small> ນີ້ຄວນເປັນຊື່ຂອງ A record, ຫຼື ທີ່ຢູ່ຂອງ <small>"
"PTR</small> record ເພື່ອຄົ້ນຫາ.\n"
"</p><p>ສຳລັບການກວດສອບ MySQL, Oracle ຫຼື PostgeSQL, ນີ້ຄວນເປັນຄຳສັ່ງສອບຖາມ (query) "
"<small>SQL</small>. ຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ສົ່ງກັບຄືນມາຈະບໍ່ຖືກກວດສອບ, ພຽງແຕ່ກວດສອບວ່າຄຳຕອບແມ່ນໜຶ່ງ ຫຼື ຫຼາຍກວ່"
"າ\n"
"ແຖວ. ນີ້ແມ່ນການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ຈຳເປັນ.\n"
"</p><p>ສຳລັບການກວດສອບ simpletcp, ຂໍ້ຄວາມນີ້ຈະຖືກສົ່ງໄປຕາມຕົວອັກສອນຕົ້ນສະບັບ ຍົກເວັ້ນທຸກໆບ່ອນທີ່ມີ "
"\\n\n"
"ແມ່ນຖືກແທນທີ່ດ້ວຍຕົວອັກສອນຂຶ້ນແຖວໃໝ່.\n"
"\n"
"\n"

#: src/include/iplb/helps.rb:212
msgid ""
"</p><p><b><big>receive</big> = \"</b><i>regexp to compare</i><b>\"</b>\n"
"</p><p>If the requested result contains this <i>regexp to compare</i>, the "
"real server is declared alive. The regexp must be inside quotes. Keep in "
"mind that\n"
"regexps are not plain strings and that you need to escape the special "
"characters if they should as literals. Note that this regexp may be "
"overridden by an\n"
"optional per real-server based receive regexp.\n"
"</p><p>For a <small>DNS</small> check this should be any one the A record's "
"addresses or any one of the <small>PTR</small> record's names.\n"
"</p><p>For a MySQL check, the receive setting is not used.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"</p><p><b><big>receive</big> = \"</b><i>ນິພົດເລກຸລາເພື່ອປຽບທຽບ</i><b>\"</b>\n"
"</p><p>ຖ້າຜົນລັດທີ່ຮ້ອງຂໍປະກອບດ້ວຍ <i>ນິພົດເລກຸລາເພື່ອປຽບທຽບ</i> ນີ້, ເຊີເວີຈິງຈະຖືກປະກາດວ່າເຮັດວຽ"
"ກຢູ່. ນິພົດເລກຸລາຕ້ອງຢູ່ໃນເຄື່ອງໝາຍຄຳເວົ້າ. ໃຫ້ຈື່ໄວ້ວ່າ\n"
"ນິພົດເລກຸລາບໍ່ແມ່ນຂໍ້ຄວາມທຳມະດາ ແລະ ທ່ານຕ້ອງໃສ່ລະຫັດຫຼົບໃຫ້ກັບຕົວອັກສອນພິເສດ ຖ້າຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ພວກມັນສະແດ"
"ງເປັນຕົວອັກສອນຕາມຕົວ. ສັງເກດວ່າ ນິພົດເລກຸລານີ້ອາດຈະຖືກຂຽນທັບໂດຍ\n"
"ນິພົດເລກຸລາການຮັບແບບເລືອກໄດ້ທີ່ອີງຕາມແຕ່ລະເຊີເວີຈິງ.\n"
"</p><p>ສຳລັບການກວດສອບ <small>DNS</small> ນີ້ຄວນຈະເປັນທີ່ຢູ່ໃດໜຶ່ງຂອງ A record ຫຼື ຊື່ໃດໜຶ່ງຂອ"
"ງ <small>PTR</small> record.\n"
"</p><p>ສຳລັບການກວດສອບ MySQL, ການຕັ້ງຄ່າການຮັບແມ່ນບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້.\n"
"\n"
"\n"

#: src/include/iplb/helps.rb:220
msgid ""
"</p><p><b><big>http method</big> = <small>GET</small></b> | <b><small>HEAD</"
"small></b>\n"
"</p><p>Sets the <small>HTTP</small> method which should be used to fetch the "
"<small>URI</small> specified in the request-string. <small>GET</small> is "
"the\n"
"method used by default if the parameter is not set. If <small>HEAD</small> "
"is used, the receive-string should be unset.\n"
"</p><p>Default: <small>GET</small>\n"
"\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"</p><p><b><big>ວິທີການ http</big> = <small>GET</small></b> | <b><small>HEAD</"
"small></b>\n"
"</p><p>ຕັ້ງຄ່າວິທີການ <small>HTTP</small> ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ເພື່ອດຶງຂໍ້ມູນ <small>URI</small> ທີ່ລະບຸໃນ "
"request-string.\n"
"<small>GET</small> ແມ່ນວິທີເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. ຖ້າໃຊ້ <small>HEAD</small>, ບໍ່ຄວນຕັ້ງຄ່າ receive-"
"string.\n"
"</p><p>ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ: <small>GET</small>\n"
"\n"
"\n"

#: src/include/iplb/helps.rb:226
msgid ""
"</p><p><b><big>virtual host</big> = \"</b><i>hostname</i><b>\"</b>\n"
"</p><p>Used when using a negotiate check with <small>HTTP</small> or "
"<small>HTTPS</small> . Sets the host header used in the <small>HTTP</small> "
"request. In the\n"
"case of <small>HTTPS</small> this generally needs to match the common name "
"of the <small>SSL</small> certificate. If not set then the host header will "
"be\n"
"derived from the request url for the real server if present. As a last "
"resort the <small>IP</small> address of the real server will be used.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"</p><p><b><big>ໂຮສສະເມືອນ</big> = \"</b><i>hostname</i><b>\"</b>\n"
"</p><p>ໃຊ້ເມື່ອກວດສອບແບບ negotiate ດ້ວຍ <small>HTTP</small> ຫຼື <small>HTTPS</"
"small>. \n"
"ໃຊ້ກຳນົດ host header ໃນຄຳຂໍ <small>HTTP</small>. ສຳລັບ <small>HTTPS</small>, ໂດຍທົ່"
"ວໄປຕ້ອງກົງກັບ \n"
"ຊື່ (common name) ໃນໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ <small>SSL</small>.\n"
"\n"
"\n"

#: src/include/iplb/helps.rb:232
msgid ""
"</p><p><b><big>login</big> = \"</b><i>username</i><b>\"</b>\n"
"</p><p>For <small>FTP</small> , <small>IMAP</small> , <small>LDAP</small> , "
"MySQL, Oracle, <small>POP</small> and PostgreSQL, the username used to log "
"in.\n"
"</p><p>For Radius the passwd is used for the attribute User-Name.\n"
"</p><p>For <small>SIP</small> , the username is used as both the to and from "
"address for an <small>OPTIONS</small> query.\n"
"</p><p>Default:\n"
"</p></dt><dt>* <small>FTP:</small> Anonymous\n"
"</dt><dt>* MySQL Oracle, and PostgreSQL: Must be specified in the "
"configuration\n"
"</dt><dt>* <small>SIP:</small> ldirectord@&lt;hostname&gt;, hostname is "
"derived as per the passwd option below.\n"
"</dt><dt>* Otherwise: empty string, which denotes that case authentication "
"will not be attempted.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"</p><p><b><big>login</big> = \"</b><i>ຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້</i><b>\"</b>\n"
"</p><p>ສຳລັບ <small>FTP</small> , <small>IMAP</small> , <small>LDAP</small> , "
"MySQL, Oracle, <small>POP</small> ແລະ PostgreSQL, ແມ່ນຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ.\n"
"</p><p>ສຳລັບ Radius ແມ່ນໃຊ້ passwd ສຳລັບຄຸນລັກສະນະ User-Name.\n"
"</p><p>ສຳລັບ <small>SIP</small> , ຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ແມ່ນຖືກໃຊ້ເປັນທັງທີ່ຢູ່ \"ເຖິງ\" (to) ແລະ \"ຈາກ\" "
"(from) ສຳລັບການສອບຖາມ <small>OPTIONS</small>.\n"
"</p><p>ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ:\n"
"</p></dt><dt>* <small>FTP:</small> Anonymous\n"
"</dt><dt>* MySQL Oracle, ແລະ PostgreSQL: ຕ້ອງໄດ້ຖືກລະບຸໃນການກຳນົດຄ່າ\n"
"</dt><dt>* <small>SIP:</small> ldirectord@&lt;hostname&gt;, ຊື່ໂຮສແມ່ນໄດ້ມາຕາມຕົວເ"
"ລືອກ passwd ທາງລຸ່ມນີ້.\n"
"</dt><dt>* ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ: ສະຕຣິງຫວ່າງເປົ່າ, ເຊິ່ງໝາຍຄວາມວ່າຈະບໍ່ມີການພະຍາຍາມຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນໃນກໍລະນີນັ້"
"ນ.\n"
"\n"
"\n"

#: src/include/iplb/helps.rb:243
msgid ""
"</dt><dt><b><big>password</big> = \"</b><i>password</i><b>\"</b>\n"
"<p>Password to use to login to <small>FTP</small> , <small>IMAP</small> , "
"<small>LDAP</small> , MySQL, Oracle, <small>POP</small> , PostgreSQL and\n"
"<small>SIP</small> servers.\n"
"</p><p>For Radius the passwd is used for the attribute User-Password.\n"
"</p><p>Default:\n"
"</p></dt><dt>* <small>FTP:</small> ldirectord@&lt;hostname&gt;, where "
"hostname is the environment variable <small>HOSTNAME</small> evaluated at "
"run time, or sourced\n"
"from uname if unset.\n"
"</dt><dt>* Otherwise: empty string. In the case of <small>LDAP</small> , "
"MySQL, Oracle, and PostgreSQL this means that authentication will not be "
"performed.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"</dt><dt><b><big>ລະຫັດຜ່ານ</big> = \"</b><i>ລະຫັດຜ່ານ</i><b>\"</b>\n"
"<p>ລະຫັດຜ່ານເພື່ອໃຊ້ເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ <small>FTP</small> , <small>IMAP</small> , <small>"
"LDAP</small> , MySQL, Oracle, <small>POP</small> , PostgreSQL ແລະ\n"
"<small>SIP</small> ເຊີເວີ.\n"
"</p><p>ສຳລັບ Radius ລະຫັດຜ່ານແມ່ນຖືກໃຊ້ສຳລັບຄຸນລັກສະນະ User-Password.\n"
"</p><p>ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ:\n"
"</p></dt><dt>* <small>FTP:</small> ldirectord@&lt;hostname&gt;, ບ່ອນທີ່ "
"hostname ແມ່ນຕົວປ່ຽນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ <small>HOSTNAME</small> ທີ່ປະເມີນໃນຕອນທີ່ເຮັດວຽກ, ຫຼື ດຶງ"
"ມາ\n"
"ຈາກ uname ຖ້າບໍ່ໄດ້ກຳນົດຄ່າ.\n"
"</dt><dt>* ກໍລະນີອື່ນໆ: ຂໍ້ຄວາມວ່າງເປົ່າ. ໃນກໍລະນີຂອງ <small>LDAP</small> , MySQL, "
"Oracle, ແລະ PostgreSQL ນີ້ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າການກວດສອບສິດຈະບໍ່ຖືກດຳເນີນການ.\n"
"\n"
"\n"

#: src/include/iplb/helps.rb:253
msgid ""
"</dt><dt><b><big>database name</big> = \"</b><i>databasename</i><b>\"</b>\n"
"<p>Database to use for MySQL, Oracle and PostgreSQL servers, this is the "
"database that the query (set by <b>receive</b> above) will be performed "
"against. This\n"
"is a required setting.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"</dt><dt><b><big>ຊື່ຖານຂໍ້ມູນ</big> = \"</b><i>databasename</i><b>\"</b>\n"
"<p>ຖານຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ສຳລັບ MySQL, Oracle ແລະ PostgreSQL. ນີ້ແມ່ນຖານຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ການສອບຖາມຈະຖືກປະຕິບັ"
"ດ. \n"
"ນີ້ແມ່ນການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ຈຳເປັນ.\n"
"\n"
"\n"

#: src/include/iplb/helps.rb:258
msgid ""
"</p><p><b><big>radius secret</big> = \"</b><i>radiussecret</i><b>\"</b>\n"
"</p><p>Secret to use for Radius servers, this is the secret used to perform "
"an Access-Request with the username (set by <b>login</b> above) and passwd "
"(set by\n"
"<b>passwd</b> above).\n"
"</p><p>Default: empty string\n"
"\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"</p><p><b><big>ລະຫັດລັບ radius</big> = \"</b><i>radiussecret</i><b>\"</b>\n"
"</p><p>ລະຫັດລັບສຳລັບໃຊ້ກັບແມ່ຂ່າຍ Radius, ນີ້ແມ່ນລະຫັດລັບທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອສົ່ງຄຳຮ້ອງຂໍການເຂົ້າເຖິງ (Access-"
"Request) ດ້ວຍຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ (ກຳນົດໂດຍ <b>ເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ</b> ຂ້າງເທິງ) ແລະ ລະຫັດຜ່ານ (ກຳນົດໂດຍ\n"
"<b>ລະຫັດຜ່ານ</b> ຂ້າງເທິງ).\n"
"</p><p>ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ: ຂໍ້ຄວາມຫວ່າງເປົ່າ\n"
"\n"
"\n"

#: src/include/iplb/helps.rb:264
msgid ""
"</p><p><b><big>persistent</big> =</b> <i>n</i>\n"
"</p><p>Number of seconds for persistent client connections.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"</p><p><b><big>ຄົງຄ້າງ (persistent)</big> =</b> <i>n</i>\n"
"</p><p>ຈຳນວນວິນາທີສຳລັບການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຂອງລູກຄ້າແບບຄົງຄ້າງ.\n"
"\n"
"\n"

#: src/include/iplb/helps.rb:268
msgid ""
"</p><p><b><big>netmask</big> =</b> <i>w.x.y.z</i>\n"
"</p><p>Netmask to be used for granularity of persistent client connections.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"</p><p><b><big>ເນັດມາກ (netmask)</big> =</b> <i>w.x.y.z</i>\n"
"</p><p>Netmask ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ສຳລັບຄວາມລະອຽດຂອງການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ລູກຄ້າແບບຄົງຄ້າງ.\n"
"\n"
"\n"

#: src/include/iplb/helps.rb:272
msgid ""
"</p><p><b><big>scheduler</big> =</b> <i>scheduler_name</i>\n"
"</p><p>Scheduler to be used by <small>LVS</small> for loadbalancing. For an "
"information on the available sehedulers please see the <b><a href=\"ipvsadm"
"\">ipvsadm</a></b>(8) man page.\n"
"</p><p>Default: \"wrr\"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"</p><p><b><big>scheduler</big> =</b> <i>ຊື່_ຕົວຈັດສັນ</i>\n"
"</p><p>ຕົວຈັດສັນທີ່ຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໂດຍ <small>LVS</small> ສຳລັບການກະຈາຍພາລະ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບຕົວ"
"ຈັດສັນທີ່ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ ກະລຸນາເບິ່ງໃນໜ້າຄູ່ມືຂອງ <b><a href=\"ipvsadm\">ipvsadm</a></b>(8).\n"
"</p><p>ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ: \"wrr\"\n"
"\n"
"\n"

#: src/include/iplb/helps.rb:277
msgid ""
"</p><p><b><big>protocol</big> = tcp</b>|<b>udp</b>|<b>fwm</b>\n"
"</p><p>Protocol to be used. If the virtual is specified as an <small>IP</"
"small> address and port then it must be one of tcp or udp. If a firewall "
"mark then the\n"
"protocol must be fwm.\n"
"</p><p>Default:\n"
"</p></dt><dt>* Virtual is an <small>IP</small> address and port, and the "
"port is not 53: tcp\n"
"</dt><dt>* Virtual is an <small>IP</small> address and port, and the port is "
"53: udp\n"
"</dt><dt>* Virtual is a firewall mark: fwm\n"
"</dt></dl>\n"
"\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"</p><p><b><big>protocol</big> = tcp</b>|<b>udp</b>|<b>fwm</b>\n"
"</p><p>ໂປຣໂຕຄໍທີ່ຈະນຳໃຊ້. ຖ້າ Virtual ຖືກກຳນົດເປັນທີ່ຢູ່ <small>IP</small> ແລະ ພອດ ແລ້ວ ມັນ"
"ຕ້ອງແມ່ນ tcp ຫຼື udp. ຖ້າແມ່ນເຄື່ອງໝາຍໄຟວໍ ແລ້ວ\n"
"ໂປຣໂຕຄໍຕ້ອງແມ່ນ fwm.\n"
"</p><p>ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ:\n"
"</p></dt><dt>* Virtual ແມ່ນທີ່ຢູ່ <small>IP</small> ແລະ ພອດ, ແລະ ພອດບໍ່ແມ່ນ 53: tcp\n"
"</dt><dt>* Virtual ແມ່ນທີ່ຢູ່ <small>IP</small> ແລະ ພອດ, ແລະ ພອດແມ່ນ 53: udp\n"
"</dt><dt>* Virtual ແມ່ນເຄື່ອງໝາຍໄຟວໍ: fwm\n"
"</dt></dl>\n"
"\n"
"\n"

#: src/include/iplb/helps.rb:329
msgid ""
"</p><p><b><big>quiescent</big> = yes</b>|<b>no</b>\n"
"</p><p>If <i>yes</i>, then when real or failback servers are determined to "
"be down, they are not actually removed from the kernel's <small>LVS</small> "
"table.\n"
"Rather, their weight is set to zero which means that no new connections will "
"be accepted.\n"
"</p><p>This has the side effect, that if the real server has persistent "
"connections, new connections from any existing clients will continue to be "
"routed to the\n"
"real server, until the persistant timeout can expire. See ipvsadm for more "
"information on persistant connections.\n"
"</p><p>This side-effect can be avoided by running the following:\n"
"</p><p>echo 1 &gt; /proc/sys/net/ipv4/vs/expire_quiescent_template\n"
"</p><p>If the proc file isn't present this probably means that the kernel "
"doesn't have lvs support, <small>LVS</small> support isn't loaded, or the "
"kernel is too\n"
"old to have the proc file. Running ipvsadm as root should load <small>LVS</"
"small> into the kernel if it is possible.\n"
"</p><p>If <i>no</i>, then the real or failback servers will be removed from "
"the kernel's <small>LVS</small> table. The default is <i>yes</i>.\n"
"</p><p>If defined in a virtual server section then the global value is "
"overridden.\n"
"</p><p>Default: <i>yes</i>\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"</p><p><b><big>quiescent</big> = ແມ່ນ</b>|<b>ບໍ່</b>\n"
"</p><p>ຖ້າເລືອກ <i>ແມ່ນ</i>, ເມື່ອເຊີເວີຈິງ ຫຼື ເຊີເວີສຳຮອງຖືກກວດພົບວ່າຢຸດເຮັດວຽກ, ພວກມັນຈະບໍ່ຖືກຍ້"
"າຍອອກຈາກຕາຕະລາງ <small>LVS</small> ຂອງເຄີນເນວ.\n"
"ແຕ່ຄ່ານ້ຳໜັກຂອງພວກມັນຈະຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນສູນ ເຊິ່ງໝາຍຄວາມວ່າຈະບໍ່ມີການຮັບການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໃໝ່.\n"
"</p><p>ຜົນກະທົບຂ້າງຄຽງຂອງມັນແມ່ນ ຖ້າເຊີເວີຈິງມີການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ແບບຕໍ່ເນື່ອງ, ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໃໝ່ຈາກໄຄລແອນ "
"(client) ທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ ຈະຍັງຄົງຖືກສົ່ງຕໍ່ໄປຫາ\n"
"ເຊີເວີຈິງ, ຈົນກວ່າເວລາຂອງການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ແບບຕໍ່ເນື່ອງຈະໝົດອາຍຸ. ເບິ່ງ ipvsadm ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບກາ"
"ນເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ແບບຕໍ່ເນື່ອງ.\n"
"</p><p>ຜົນກະທົບຂ້າງຄຽງນີ້ສາມາດຫຼີກເວັ້ນໄດ້ໂດຍການໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງດັ່ງນີ້:\n"
"</p><p>echo 1 > /proc/sys/net/ipv4/vs/expire_quiescent_template\n"
"</p><p>ຖ້າບໍ່ພົບໄຟລ໌ proc ນີ້ ອາດຈະໝາຍຄວາມວ່າ ເຄີນເນວບໍ່ຮອງຮັບ lvs, ການຮອງຮັບ <small>LVS</"
"small> ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກໂຫຼດ, ຫຼື ເຄີນເນວເກົ່າເກີນໄປ\n"
"ຈົນບໍ່ມີໄຟລ໌ proc ດັ່ງກ່າວ. ການໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ ipvsadm ໃນຖານະ root ຄວນຈະໂຫຼດ <small>LVS</"
"small> ເຂົ້າໄປໃນເຄີນເນວຖ້າສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້.\n"
"</p><p>ຖ້າເລືອກ <i>ບໍ່</i>, ເຊີເວີຈິງ ຫຼື ເຊີເວີສຳຮອງຈະຖືກຍ້າຍອອກຈາກຕາຕະລາງ <small>LVS</"
"small> ຂອງເຄີນເນວ. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ <i>ແມ່ນ</i>.\n"
"</p><p>ຖ້າຖືກກຳນົດຢູ່ໃນສ່ວນຂອງເຊີເວີສະເໝືອນ (virtual server) ຄ່າສ່ວນກາງຈະຖືກແທນທີ່.\n"
"</p><p>ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ: <i>ແມ່ນ</i>\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"

#. overwrite global value part
#: src/include/iplb/vserver_conf.rb:146
msgid "Check Type"
msgstr "ປະເພດການກວດສອບ"

#: src/include/iplb/vserver_conf.rb:150
msgid "Check Port"
msgstr "ພອດກວດສອບ"

#: src/include/iplb/vserver_conf.rb:151
msgid "Service"
msgstr "ບໍລິການ"

#: src/include/iplb/vserver_conf.rb:152
msgid "Check Command"
msgstr "ຄຳສັ່ງກວດສອບ"

#: src/include/iplb/vserver_conf.rb:157
msgid "Http Method"
msgstr "ວິທີການ Http"

#: src/include/iplb/vserver_conf.rb:160
msgid "Request"
msgstr "ຄຳຂໍ (Request)"

#: src/include/iplb/vserver_conf.rb:162
msgid "Receive"
msgstr "ການຕອບຮັບ (Receive)"

#: src/include/iplb/vserver_conf.rb:165
msgid "Virtual Host"
msgstr "ໂຮສສະເມືອນ"

#: src/include/iplb/vserver_conf.rb:177
msgid "Login"
msgstr "ເຂົ້າລະບົບ"

#: src/include/iplb/vserver_conf.rb:178
msgid "Password"
msgstr "ລະຫັດຜ່ານ"

#: src/include/iplb/vserver_conf.rb:180
msgid "Database Name"
msgstr "ຊື່ຖານຂໍ້ມູນ"

#: src/include/iplb/vserver_conf.rb:181
msgid "Radius Secret"
msgstr "ຄວາມລັບ Radius"

